WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.342
This slide brings Module 4 together.

00:00:02.342 --> 00:00:05.832
Review the patterns you can now recognize and reuse.

00:00:05.832 --> 00:00:11.347
Focus on the decisions behind the syntax: what structure or method fits the problem,

00:00:11.347 --> 00:00:15.992
what assumptions are being made, and what you should check before trusting the result.

00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:19.887
Think of the sequence as a small collection of observations.

00:00:19.887 --> 00:00:26.592
Ask whether order matters, whether values need to change, and whether you need one item, a range,

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:28.972
or a summary of the entire collection.

00:00:28.972 --> 00:00:34.732
Before moving on, explain the main idea in one sentence without reading the slide.

00:00:34.732 --> 00:00:40.149
That quick explanation is a useful check that the concept is becoming reusable knowledge.
